---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Icons from '../../components/Icons.astro';
import { breadcrumbSchema, contextWrapper, orgSchema } from '../../lib/schema';

const hreflang = [
  { lang: 'en', url: 'https://www.topvpn.top/about' },
  { lang: 'ar', url: 'https://www.topvpn.top/ar/about' },
  { lang: 'pcm', url: 'https://www.topvpn.top/pcm/about' },
  { lang: 'x-default', url: 'https://www.topvpn.top/about' },
];

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'About' },
];

const quickLinks = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Compare VPNs', href: '/order-vpn' },
  { label: 'VPN Guides', href: '/vpn-types-guide' },
  { label: 'Articles', href: '/articles' },
  { label: 'Contact Us', href: '/contact' },
  { label: 'Affiliate Disclosure', href: '/affiliate-disclosure' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About TopVPN — Our Story, from GoldenVPN to TopVPN"
  description="Story of TopVPN: more than ten years in VPN market, from GoldenVPN to TopVPN. Better VPN service for price wey make sense, with clear talk and trust."
  lang="pcm"
  hreflang={hreflang}
  autolink={false}
  ogLocale="pcm_NG"
  jsonLd={contextWrapper([orgSchema, breadcrumbSchema(breadcrumbs)])}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

  <section class="container-max py-8 md:py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">
      About <span class="gold-text">TopVPN</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">From GoldenVPN to TopVPN</h2>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            Plenty years pass, we start our journey for VPN market through affiliate partnership with big
            VPN providers.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            As time waka, we learn plenty things and see the real wahala wey customers dey face when dem wan
            buy, set up, or use VPN service.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            Later, we run some VPN websites. Plenty customers for different countries still remember
            <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">GoldenVPN.com</strong> — na important chapter for our story.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            That time, VPN protocol and device support no too plenty like now. We work hard to make buying
            and setting up VPN easy for different devices, from Windows 7 computer to the phones wey dey
            that time. Our goal na to join better price with easy experience.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            Today, with more years of experience and new commitment, we continue the journey under new name:
            <strong style="color: var(--color-gold-light);">TOPVPN.TOP</strong>. The name show our plan to
            give top-quality VPN service for price wey make sense, with clear information and simple
            customer experience.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Wetin Experience Teach Us</h2>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            Our work with big VPN companies show us say the uptime number wey dem dey advertise no always
            match wetin every customer see for real life. Some users talk about problem wey dey repeat for
            some servers or connection condition.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            We believe say clear talk better pass promise wey no go work. No VPN service fit guarantee
            perfect connection every time.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            We see challenge as chance to learn, improve, and give better customer experience. Our promise
            na to dey improve, talk true, and listen to customer feedback.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Trust and Customer Support</h2>
          <p class="mb-3" style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-gold-light);">
            “Our greatest asset na your trust, and to earn am na work wey no dey stop.”
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            If you need help, you go find am for our
            <a href="/pcm#faq" class="underline" style="color: var(--color-muted);">FAQ section</a>
            and our
            <a href="/contact" class="underline" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Contact Us page</a>.
            We dey also add support assistant for the site so you go get answer quick.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            TopVPN want give better VPN service for price wey make sense, with easy buying, safe payment,
            and promise to dey improve customer experience.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">How We Earn</h2>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            We fit earn commission from some links for this site, and e no go add any cost for you. This one
            help us keep TopVPN dey run and still dey write free content.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            E no dey change our honest pros and cons. If one VPN get weakness, we go tell you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Payment Options</h2>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
            We dey roll out safe checkout for TopVPN Premium. Card payment dey go through
            <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">Stripe</strong>, and we dey enable
            <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">PayPal</strong> and
            <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">cryptocurrency</strong> as other options.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-3">
            <Icons name="visa" size={28} />
            <Icons name="mastercard" size={28} />
            <Icons name="amex" size={28} />
            <Icons name="paypal" size={28} />
            <Icons name="crypto" size={28} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs" style="color: var(--color-muted-dark);">
            Card payment through Stripe na the main method. PayPal and cryptocurrency dey plan and e never
            ready for TopVPN Premium order. We no go ever ask you to put payment details for unsafe form,
            and your card details no dey pass our server.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-1">
        <div class="card p-6 sticky top-20">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">Quick Links</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            {quickLinks.map((link) => (
              <li><a href={link.href} style="color: var(--color-muted);">{link.label}</a></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 md:py-16" style="background: var(--color-bg-alt);">
    <div class="container-max text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);">
        TOPVPN.TOP — <span class="gold-text">Better VPN Service for Price Wey Make Sense.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base mb-6" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
        And wait for special offers wey you go only see for TopVPN.
      </p>
      <a href="/pcm#plans" class="btn-gold inline-flex">See our plans</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
